# Lab 07 — Azure Storage

## Objective

Learn how to securely use Azure Storage from a private Azure network.

### Goals

* Create and use Blob Storage
* Configure Private Endpoint
* Configure Private DNS
* Use Managed Identity + RBAC
* Understand Blob access tiers
* Configure Lifecycle Management
* Understand Azure Files and its use cases

