## Blob Storage

Created container:

```text
web-logs
```

Created and uploaded:

```text
web-logs/test.log
```

The VM created a normal Linux file:

```text
/tmp/test.log
```

and uploaded it to Blob Storage.

Important:

> RBAC does not create the file. RBAC authorizes the VM's identity to perform Blob data operations.

---

## Private Endpoint + Private DNS

### Blob

Private Endpoint:

```text
10.0.2.4
```

Private DNS Zone:

```text
privatelink.blob.core.windows.net
```

Verified:

```text
lab07storage867660b2.blob.core.windows.net
        ↓
10.0.2.4
```

### Azure Files

Private Endpoint:

```text
10.0.2.5
```

Private DNS Zone:

```text
privatelink.file.core.windows.net
```

Verified:

```text
lab07storage867660b2.file.core.windows.net
        ↓
10.0.2.5
```

### Key concept

Private Endpoint and Private DNS have different roles.

```text
Private Endpoint
= Private network path

Private DNS
= Name resolution to the private IP
```

